status-sign-in-save = Log in om in de bibliotheek op te slaan
status-sign-in-subscribe = Log in om te abonneren
status-sign-in-upload = Log in om muziek te uploaden
status-upload-formats = YouTube Music accepteert alleen MP3, M4A, FLAC, OGG en WMA
status-uploading = Nummers uploaden: { $count }…
